{"src":"pt","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":208300,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"pt","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"commercial","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7352.946786999999,"text":"Leões são os felinos mais sociais, vivendo em grandes grupos chamados de alcateias."},{"kind":"text","t":7660.864866,"text":"Lions are the most social felines, living in large groups called prides."},{"kind":"audio","t":7696.913827999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":7701.724539999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":7706.7630690000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":7711.362773999999,"samples":31896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"input","t":13146.197372999999,"text":"No clima quente do Oriente Médio, a caça não era tão importante."},{"kind":"text","t":13403.280789,"text":"In the hot climate of the Middle East, hunting wasn’t as important."},{"kind":"audio","t":13435.834879,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13436.959674,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13438.441563,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":13438.891056,"samples":15096,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":22586.222945999998,"text":"Elas são quase todas praias arenosas, com nado seguro. E muitas têm sombras provenientes das árvores Porrutucaua."},{"kind":"text","t":22890.804702,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming conditions. And many have shadows from the Porrutucaua trees."},{"kind":"audio","t":22961.987599,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22967.110566,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22972.596749,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":22973.185921,"samples":12096,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":23033.951734,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23039.069132,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23041.966921,"samples":22664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":29922.009395,"text":"Os bandos consistem de um a três machos adultos da mesma família."},{"kind":"text","t":30163.965594,"text":"The groups consist of one to three adult males from the same family."},{"kind":"audio","t":30228.065481,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":30229.783986,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":30231.685269999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":30232.118273,"samples":16896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":70},{"kind":"input","t":33803.187398,"text":"Junto com até 30 fêmeas e filhotes."},{"kind":"text","t":34004.183424,"text":"Along with up to 30 females and young."},{"kind":"audio","t":34050.975365,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34056.153272,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":34056.948161,"samples":10064,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":42693.317484,"text":"Crianças que são revoltadas podem ter sofrido sérios traumas ou abusos na infância, antes de serem abandonadas ou terem fugido de casa."},{"kind":"text","t":43076.504972,"text":"Children who become rebellious may have suffered severe trauma or abuse in childhood, before being abandoned or running away from home."},{"kind":"audio","t":43129.395246,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43130.784426,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43132.269855,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43133.877413,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43135.333972,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43136.990049,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43138.32736,"samples":32592,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":710},{"kind":"input","t":52361.890135,"text":"O ônibus Scott Turb 403 viaja para Sintra frequentemente, comparada no Cabo da Roca."},{"kind":"text","t":52750.626355,"text":"The Scott Turb 403 bus travels to Sintra frequently, often passing by Cabo da Roca."},{"kind":"audio","t":52800.106207,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52805.195005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52810.415562,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":52815.49143,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52820.919044,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":52821.418427,"samples":10160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":60954.469206,"text":"Para ter as melhores vistas de Hong Kong, saia da ilha e vá até a orla de Kowloon."},{"kind":"text","t":61315.105822,"text":"To get the best views of Hong Kong, leave the island and head to the coast of Kowloon."},{"kind":"audio","t":61352.588143,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61357.460394,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":950},{"kind":"audio","t":61362.837889,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61368.102534,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61370.005227,"samples":15928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":10},{"kind":"input","t":63272.147841,"text":"Do lado oposto."},{"kind":"text","t":63381.289982,"text":"On the opposite side."},{"kind":"audio","t":63408.876163,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":63409.471525,"samples":17632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":220},{"kind":"input","t":69226.489386,"text":"Todos os pensamentos científicos de Aristóteles foram aceitos, inclusive a psicologia."},{"kind":"text","t":69430.044606,"text":"All of Aristotle’s scientific ideas were accepted, including psychology."},{"kind":"audio","t":69466.101008,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69471.343254,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69476.647189,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69482.358698,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":970},{"kind":"audio","t":69482.678304,"samples":5128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":77738.752089,"text":"Mitchell Gurley, australiano, terminou de pé em 11º no Super G masculino."},{"kind":"text","t":78000.176193,"text":"Australian Mitchell Gurley finished 11th in the men’s Super G."},{"kind":"audio","t":78046.436311,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":78048.078788,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78050.004431,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":78050.333366,"samples":10896,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":83324.999093,"text":"O concorrente tcheco, Odric Jelinek, finalizou sentado"},{"kind":"text","t":83559.506518,"text":"The Czech competitor, Odric Jelinek, finished sitting down."},{"kind":"audio","t":83602.64519,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83607.857786,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83613.172711,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"audio","t":83613.488517,"samples":2496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":87186.447755,"text":"Em 16º no Super G masculino."},{"kind":"text","t":87364.876529,"text":"16th in the men's Super G."},{"kind":"audio","t":87406.556991,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87409.131125,"samples":30832,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"input","t":97560.756846,"text":"A cidade contrasta fortemente com o resto do país porque tem um toque mais árabe do que africano."},{"kind":"text","t":97930.472434,"text":"The city stands in sharp contrast to the rest of the country because it has a more Arab than African influence."},{"kind":"audio","t":97981.952568,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97987.122745,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97992.282353,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":920},{"kind":"audio","t":97997.542828,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98002.972642,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98005.669724,"samples":19160,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":230},{"kind":"input","t":106065.246409,"text":"Ademais, posteriormente à Revolução, foram abertas vagas a todos os candidatos do sexo masculino."},{"kind":"text","t":106319.761121,"text":"Furthermore, after the Revolution, positions were opened up to all male candidates."},{"kind":"audio","t":106356.72501,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":106361.797418,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106367.643296,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":106372.397609,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106374.006706,"samples":15328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":100},{"kind":"input","t":111130.724425,"text":"possibilitando que os mais ambiciosos e bem-sucedidos tivessem sucesso."},{"kind":"text","t":111311.516506,"text":"allowing the most ambitious and successful to thrive."},{"kind":"audio","t":111352.280782,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111356.129197,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111358.481604,"samples":29864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"input","t":124264.333546,"text":"A bomba de fissão funciona pautada no princípio de que é necessária uma energia para construir um núcleo com diversos prótons e nêutrons."},{"kind":"text","t":124661.918281,"text":"A fission bomb operates on the principle that energy is required to create a nucleus with multiple protons and neutrons."},{"kind":"audio","t":124704.056317,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":124709.598528,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124714.945493,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124720.097,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124725.307067,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124730.658712,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":124733.098057,"samples":18192,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":200},{"kind":"input","t":133469.834256,"text":"Ele não definiu um valor para os cortes, falando que eles serão feitos de acordo com a produção econômica da China."},{"kind":"text","t":133838.166483,"text":"He did not set a specific figure for the cuts, saying they would be determined based on China’s economic production."},{"kind":"audio","t":133888.85247800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133894.17966300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":133899.35242,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133904.719145,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133910.07370900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133913.46694100002,"samples":24560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":140132.83279000001,"text":"Não há definição universal que especifique quais itens manufaturados são antiguidades."},{"kind":"text","t":140357.70850900002,"text":"There is no universal definition specifying which manufactured items are antiques."},{"kind":"audio","t":140403.07135,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140408.04525000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":140413.362945,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140418.67677000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140422.87817,"samples":27928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":600},{"kind":"input","t":145441.519017,"text":"Algumas agências fiscais definem que itens com mais de 100 anos são antiguidades."},{"kind":"text","t":145707.56128700002,"text":"Some tax authorities define items over 100 years old as antiques."},{"kind":"audio","t":145743.145825,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145748.328622,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":145753.50231900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145759.18877900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":145759.50037400002,"samples":6328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":152328.468724,"text":"Nos arquipélagos e lagos você não precisa necessariamente de um iate."},{"kind":"text","t":152579.87755,"text":"On archipelagos and lakes, you don’t necessarily need a yacht."},{"kind":"audio","t":152609.199006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152610.624576,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152612.24935300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152613.022372,"samples":16896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":40},{"kind":"input","t":160046.716661,"text":"A proporção de tela desse formato, dividindo por 12 para obter a menor razão entre números inteiros,"},{"kind":"text","t":160368.62094300002,"text":"The screen ratio of this format, divided by 12 to obtain the smallest ratio among integers."},{"kind":"audio","t":160415.347324,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":160420.38491300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":160425.58976,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":160430.924785,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":160436.518026,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"audio","t":160436.785012,"samples":5360,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":163493.60248700003,"text":"É, portanto, de 3 para 2."},{"kind":"text","t":163658.287805,"text":"It is therefore 3 to 2."},{"kind":"audio","t":163700.368882,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163704.02304,"samples":27232,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":580},{"kind":"input","t":172275.259882,"text":"Sua fama de epicentro do luxo começou por volta de 400 d.C. e durou até cerca de 1100 d.C."},{"kind":"text","t":172669.89099800002,"text":"Its reputation as a center of luxury began around 400 AD and lasted until around 1100 AD."},{"kind":"audio","t":172714.00641600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":172719.10853400003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":172724.18203300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":172729.472188,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":172734.492147,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":172739.912351,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":172745.59327100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":810},{"kind":"audio","t":172745.910986,"samples":2824,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":185933.502256,"text":"As políticas de cancelamento variam, mas no final de março, a maioria das políticas de cancelamento por causa do coronavírus não se estenderam até julho de 2020."},{"kind":"text","t":186362.267721,"text":"Cancellation policies vary, but by the end of March, most coronavirus-related cancellation policies had not extended until July 2020."},{"kind":"audio","t":186419.505974,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":186424.942038,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":850},{"kind":"audio","t":186430.22206300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":186435.52305800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":310,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":186440.856173,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":186446.16369800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":186450.571586,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":186453.551264,"samples":32224,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"input","t":188800.302369,"text":"quando as Olimpíadas foram agendadas."},{"kind":"text","t":188925.85654900002,"text":"when the Olympics were scheduled."},{"kind":"audio","t":188967.57445100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":188970.66767800003,"samples":26632,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":580},{"kind":"input","t":195842.256911,"text":"misture os dois pós e com as mãos limpas molde-os no formato de uma bola"},{"kind":"text","t":196109.74014,"text":"Mix the two powders together and shape them into a ball using clean hands."},{"kind":"audio","t":196154.246503,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":196159.33699100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":196164.59894700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":196169.457178,"samples":32496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"input","t":207220.871824,"text":"Os cruzeiros em São Petersburgo incluem passeios na cidade. Os passageiros ficam isentos dos requisitos de visto. Consulte os termos."},{"kind":"text","t":207469.16548300002,"text":"Cruises in St. Petersburg include city tours. Passengers are exempt from visa requirements. Check the terms."},{"kind":"audio","t":207503.01785600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":207507.836408,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":207510.722038,"samples":22664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":360},{"kind":"audio","t":207569.697266,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":207570.95635800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":207571.750807,"samples":23264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":420},{"kind":"audio","t":207604.587594,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":207604.81116100002,"samples":9232,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":218405.20689600002,"code":1005}]}